# Delver of Secrets: "You may reveal that card. If an instant or sorcery card is revealed this way, transform." A land may
# be revealed too (the 2011-09-22 ruling) and transforms nothing: on turn 3 Bot1 reveals the top Island and Delver stays a
# 1/1. On turn 5 the top card is Lightning Bolt, and Bot1 keeps it hidden: an instant that is not revealed transforms
# nothing either. Both cards stay on top and are drawn.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Delver of Secrets
Island x5
Island
Lightning Bolt
Island x11

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Delver of Secrets.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Upkeep]
Bot1.Accept
? Bot1.Revealed = Island
[T5 Bot1.Upkeep]
Bot1.Decline
[T5 Bot1.Main1]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Island; Delver of Secrets
Bot1.Battlefield.Delver of Secrets.Power = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Delver of Secrets.Keywords = (absent)
Bot1.Looked = Island; Lightning Bolt
Bot1.Revealed = Island
Bot1.Hand.Count = 7
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Colors = Red
